WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.381
"I'm melting!

2
00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.282
It's so hot outside!"

3
00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:03.962
Bobby said.

4
00:00:04.723 --> 00:00:08.145
"The thermometer says it's 35°C," Nina said.

5
00:00:15.451 --> 00:00:16.191
really hot!"

6
00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:33.269
"We need to go inside anyway," Miss Shelly said.

7
00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:35.170
"We have to meet someone."

8
00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.971
"Who?" Nina asked.

9
00:00:37.991 --> 00:00:41.172
"You'll see," Miss Shelly replied.

10
00:00:43.353 --> 00:00:46.435
The kids saw a small, red-headed girl waiting by the office.

11
00:00:46.455 --> 00:00:49.936
"Hi, Aunt Marie!"

12
00:00:52.537 --> 00:00:54.098
Miss Shelly gave her a quick hug.

13
00:00:55.578 --> 00:00:57.379
"This is my niece Ginger.

14
00:00:58.259 --> 00:00:59.680
She's visiting us today.

15
00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:02.653
I hope you will all make her feel welcome."

16
00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:04.773
"Hey, Ginger.

17
00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:05.974
I'm Bobby."

18
00:01:07.654 --> 00:01:09.655
"Hi," Ginger said shyly.

19
00:01:10.975 --> 00:01:12.615
Izzie smiled at the younger girl.

20
00:01:12.635 --> 00:01:14.156
"I'm Izzie.

21
00:01:14.536 --> 00:01:15.796
How old are you?"

22
00:01:15.816 --> 00:01:19.597
"I just turned six," Ginger said.

23
00:01:19.617 --> 00:01:21.218
"I'm Nina.

24
00:01:21.818 --> 00:01:23.158
Do you have any pets?"

25
00:01:23.538 --> 00:01:24.339
Nina asked.

26
00:01:25.439 --> 00:01:26.259
Ginger nodded.

27
00:01:26.279 --> 00:01:28.640
"I have four bunnies."

28
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:30.881
"Four bunnies!"

29
00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:33.522
Ethan and Jason said at the same time.

30
00:01:33.542 --> 00:01:34.923
"That's awesome!

31
00:01:35.464 --> 00:01:36.044
I'm Jason."

32
00:01:36.064 --> 00:01:37.405
"And I'm Ethan."

33
00:01:38.405 --> 00:01:40.807
Bobby fanned himself as they walked toward the gym.

34
00:01:40.827 --> 00:01:47.851
"Our special activity today is cooking," Miss Shelly said.

35
00:01:47.871 --> 00:01:51.673
"This is where we cook," Bobby said.

36
00:01:53.074 --> 00:01:56.376
Miss Shelly pulled out a tray of frozen watermelon cut into cubes.

37
00:01:59.516 --> 00:02:03.537
"Yesterday, we cut up a watermelon and froze the cubes.

38
00:02:04.478 --> 00:02:09.739
Today we are going to make cool-as-a-cucumber watermelon slushies."

39
00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.720
She pointed to the board.

40
00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:14.281
"That's the ingredients list.

41
00:02:15.081 --> 00:02:17.822
Let's make sure we have everything before we start."

42
00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:24.344
"Half a cup of chopped and peeled cucumber," Jason read.

43
00:02:27.852 --> 00:02:30.573
"Four cups of frozen watermelon cubes.

44
00:02:31.274 --> 00:02:32.674
Juice from one lime.

45
00:02:36.196 --> 00:02:37.656
Ten fresh mint leaves.

46
00:02:38.477 --> 00:02:40.838
About three-fourth cup of coconut water."

47
00:02:42.939 --> 00:02:44.800
Bobby took his place behind the blender.

48
00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:48.021
"Ginger, can you please get the watermelon?"

49
00:02:48.621 --> 00:02:50.082
He handed her a measuring cup.

50
00:02:51.243 --> 00:02:54.024
Ginger scooped four cups of watermelon into the blender.

51
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.182
Bobby blended it into an icy slush.

52
00:03:02.202 --> 00:03:06.406
"What a pretty pink color!"

53
00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.426
Ginger said.

54
00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:11.069
Ethan added the cucumbers and lime juice.

55
00:03:13.932 --> 00:03:15.513
Jason tossed in the mint leaves.

56
00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.455
Izzie poured in the coconut water.

57
00:03:17.475 --> 00:03:20.838
"Final blend!"

58
00:03:21.758 --> 00:03:22.759
Bobby hit Blend.

59
00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.161
The ingredients swirled together.

60
00:03:25.181 --> 00:03:28.044
"I think it's ready now."

61
00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.682
"The first sip goes to our special guest!"

62
00:03:32.962 --> 00:03:33.622
Nina said.

63
00:03:34.883 --> 00:03:37.804
She poured Ginger an ice-cold watermelon slushie.

64
00:03:37.825 --> 00:03:42.027
"Yum!" Ginger said.

65
00:03:43.408 --> 00:03:45.509
Nina poured everyone else a tall glass.

66
00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.432
The room was quiet as everyone slurped their slushies.

67
00:03:51.452 --> 00:03:55.454
"Brr." Nina shivered.

68
00:03:55.474 --> 00:03:58.536
"I actually felt cold for a second!"

69
00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.423
"If you drink these too fast, you'll get a headache," Ethan said.

70
00:04:02.443 --> 00:04:05.025
"Thank you, Miss Shelly.

71
00:04:05.185 --> 00:04:06.326
This is delicious!"

72
00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:07.347
Bobby said.

73
00:04:08.488 --> 00:04:10.190
Miss Shelly took a sip of her slushie.

74
00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.891
"You're welcome.

75
00:04:12.412 --> 00:04:13.693
I'm a lucky teacher.

76
00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:17.256
You kids are becoming great chefs."

77
00:04:18.517 --> 00:04:19.658
Bobby looked at Ginger.

78
00:04:19.678 --> 00:04:23.161
"We do different things every day," he said.

79
00:04:23.181 --> 00:04:26.164
"Cooking days are fun because we get to eat."

80
00:04:28.032 --> 00:04:30.254
He picked up his glass and put it in the sink.

81
00:04:32.155 --> 00:04:34.937
"I just wish we didn't have to clean up afterward!"

82
00:04:37.058 --> 00:04:37.979
Ginger giggled.

83
00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.920
Nina smiled at her.

84
00:04:40.941 --> 00:04:43.662
"Thanks for coming to visit us today."

85
00:04:43.682 --> 00:04:46.844
"You're welcome," Ginger said.

86
00:04:47.445 --> 00:04:48.906
She sipped her slushie.

87
00:04:48.926 --> 00:04:52.088
"I think Kids Central is cool!"
